          "en": "if the error we're getting doesn't have that format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.68,
          "end": 222.39,
          "en": "And that could be the case, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.39,
          "end": 224.37,
          "en": "if we have a network error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 229.37,
          "en": "So, therefore, here I'll check if the errorRes does not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
